    {
     "id": "yui_3_17_2_1_1715577318247_7190",
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<h1><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--accent\">Portraits with a twist</span></h1><p>People get portraits for many reasons. To celebrate and record a milestone, as part of a professional portfolio, to leave a precious memory for their family or just because they enjoy it. </p><p>I can do portraits almost anywhere. I can do them in your house or somewhere special to you or we could get into a studio for a more formal look. </p><p>It all starts with an idea. I would love to chat to you about what you are thinking, how I can make that happen but also how I can add value and ideas to really bring out the very best of you. They say that we don’t know what we don’t know. Well, that’s why you talk to me. I can make suggestions on how to ramp things up to the next level to go from nice pictures to <span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--accent\"><strong>AMAZING</strong></span>!</p><p>I have been shooting portraits for over 10 years and in that time, I have done a bunch of really creative and classic images that make the person look and feel amazing. I like to think I am a pretty nice and friendly guy too (check some of my awesome <a href=\"/testimonials\" target=\"_blank\">feedback</a>). Having someone who is not just a photographer but also your cheer leader can bring out the best in your photos. In the studio I am great at shaping the light for the most flattering portraits, but I also know the best poses for your body type. I will send you posing guides in advance of the shoot so you can do your homework and come ready to smash them out of the park.</p><p><strong>Sssshhh we can keep a secret!</strong></p><p>They make awesome Christmas, birthday or Mother’s Day gifts. My online store lets you have these professionally printed and framed ready to gift wrap with care. Show them how much you really care.</p><p>Here is a small selection of the portraits I have done so far.</p>",
