     "id": "89fd9e10d93e2c908647",
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<h2><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--accent\">Traditional portraits or more creative, the choice is yours.</span></h2><h3>Traditional Portraits</h3><p>Want to look amazing? Want to get that captured and saved for eternity? We work with amazing markup artists or you can do your own. We can tailor a session to suit your very specific requirements. That could be at your home or a place that’s special to you, or we could hire a studio. We have a vast wealth of experience shooting portraits and we are always working to make you look the best you can. </p><p>It’s all about the experience so bring a friend and maybe some music to get the mood right, maybe a bottle of bubbles. </p><p>We are on your team, now let’s go make magic. See some examples<span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--accent\"> </span><a href=\"/portraits-gallery\" target=\"\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--accent\">here</span></a></p><h3>Creative Portraits</h3><p>Think big? If you want to go somewhere very special and create something truly unique. We are more than happy (excited) to plan a truly creative session that really stretches our creative muscles. The only limits are your imagination.</p><p>Formal or informal it all starts with an idea. We will talk with you and help you plan a brief to get the very best out of your session. <span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--accent\">See some examples </span><a href=\"/portraits-gallery\" target=\"\"><span class=\"sqsrte-text-color--accent\">here</span></a></p><p><strong>From $600 NZD</strong></p>",
     "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)",
